{"id":"BV17CxF6PEo5-001","type":"rule","dimension":"portfolio","statement":"剩余仓位对行业龙一、龙二各买约2.5个点，条件是估值在十年底部且绝对估值杀到10倍以内。","as_of":"2026-10-29","status":"candidate","confidence":"high","reviewed":false,"evidence":{"kind":"video","bvid":"BV17CxF6PEo5","t":501,"quote":"绝对估值都杀到了十倍以内"}}
